{
The Mechanical Engineers’ Guild of Azeroth, or MEGA for short, sponsors all manner of racing competitions across Azeroth. Despite rumors of lycanthropic worgen howling in the night, MEGA continues to host the Silverpine Sprint on the northern edge of Silverpine Forest.
